{"work_id":"tirumbippaar","target_language":"en","canonical_scene":22,"scene_status":"verified","unit_count":7,"units":[{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s022-u001","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s022-d001","speaker_label":"பாமா","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":30,"printed_page":22}]},"translation":{"english_text":"How many days are we to stay in a hotel? Find a house soon."}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s022-u002","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s022-d002","speaker_label":"பரந்தாமன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":30,"printed_page":22}]},"translation":{"english_text":"Let the house-hunting wait... Come, at least today let's go around and see the city."}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s022-u003","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s022-d003","speaker_label":"பாமா","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":30,"printed_page":22}]},"translation":{"english_text":"Uh-uh...first we must start a family."}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s022-u004","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s022-d004","speaker_label":"பரந்தாமன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":30,"printed_page":22}]},"translation":{"english_text":"We will. Why are you in such a hurry? What has starting a family got to do with seeing Chennai?"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s022-u005","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s022-d005","speaker_label":"பாமா","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":30,"printed_page":22}]},"translation":{"english_text":"What is there in Chennai?"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s022-u006","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s022-d006","speaker_label":"பரந்தாமன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":30,"printed_page":22}]},"translation":{"english_text":"What is there in Chennai? They tell story after story about the exhibition hall. They say the lighthouse puts even the sun to shame. Eyes that have not seen the zoo and Marina beach are sinful eyes, they say. Hmm...come! Queen of love, adorned sacred image of a jewel-beautiful palace, indelible picture. Come."}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s022-u007","kind":"stage-direction","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":null,"speaker_label":null,"page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":30,"printed_page":22}]},"translation":{"english_text":"(They leave.)","notes":["Source-visible standalone direction `(புறப்படுதல்)` restored as its own unit rather than folded into Paranthaman's dialogue."]}}]}